Revision history for Perl extension Text-ANSI-Highlight

{{$NEXT}}

0.02 2026-11-18T08:06:25Z

    - Text::ANSI::Highlight::IO: a program which reads files by <>
      reads them in colors, as it is.  It gives a highlighter to
      IO::Factotum (perl -MText::ANSI::Highlight::IO -ne ...)
    - The highlighter method tells whether a name is that of a
      highlighter
    - pl is Perl: source-highlight took it for Prolog
    - SEE ALSO has modules which do similar things
    - Requires IO::Factotum 0.05

0.01 2026-11-18T03:43:37Z

    - original version: Text::ANSI::Highlight, with the highlighters
      pandoc, sourcehighlight (gnu) and skylighting (sky), and the
      ansihighlight command

